<mxCell id="ix_note_other" value="&lt;b&gt;Routes outside /api/&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• /admin/ – Django admin (session login, staff only)&lt;br&gt;• /metrics – Prometheus metrics (django-prometheus), no authentication in code&lt;br&gt;• / and /login – institution.views.home&lt;br&gt;• /api/schema/, /api/docs/ – OpenAPI + Swagger UI, only when DEBUG is on&lt;br&gt;• /media/&amp;lt;path&amp;gt; – uploaded files, served by Django only when DEBUG is on&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Headers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Authorization: Bearer &amp;lt;access token&amp;gt; · X-Resource-UUID (required for almost all /api/performance routes) · X-API-Key, X-External-User-UUID, X-Internal-User-UUID (partner systems)." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="660" width="620" height="230" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="ix_inferred" value="&lt;b&gt;Inferred – verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Permission codes&lt;/b&gt; are read from each view class (method_permissions or literal “can_…” strings). Checks made inside serializers or services are not visible here, so “none found in view” means &lt;i&gt;verify&lt;/i&gt;, not &lt;i&gt;unprotected&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Main tables&lt;/b&gt; are the models named in the view (and the serializers it names). It is a static reading, not a trace of executed queries.&lt;br&gt;• Every authenticated route is additionally tenant-scoped through request.institution." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cc0000;fontColor=#cc0000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="660" width="620" height="200" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
